  "review": [
    "Full Git-plus-patch output is lstat-walked without following links before any reconstructed-source chmod. Every file and directory belongs to exact expected membership; special files and broken symlinks are rejected. Per-file containment and regular checks immediately precede chmod.",
    "Fresh part/retained scratch creates only regular files before delayed symlink restoration. Inventory rejects unsafe paths, link/file ancestors, external targets and unsupported types. Existing actual archive ownership, cumulative-before-open and coverage checks remain.",
    "Every inventory byte count must be an exact nonnegative integer before any sum. Hard caps are retained8,000,000 bytes, part38,000,000 bytes and compressed archive40,000,000 bytes; retained cap precedes scratch creation.",
    "Report path must be outside the capsule both lexically and after resolution; refusal happens before report creation. The inside-capsule synthetic case has no recovery report and preserves its raw stderr.",
    "The source-link-to-outside-sentinel and unexpected-broken-link controls independently isolate the prior permission and membership hazards. Negative/boolean sizes, retained cap, part cap, compressed cap, wrong-part ownership, lineage, modes and source identities each have retained controls.",
    "Original recoverer and19-case control artifacts remain immutable. Source reconstruction continues to use committed baseline plus exact patch, with complete bytes/modes verified separately from working-tree source."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No real capsule was captured or recovered by reviewer. Final root release freeze, exact inventory/selection review and disk preflight are still required.",
